      ro: ["Mormântul reginei Arwa al-Sulayhi", "Fost palat regal", "Important loc de pelerinaj istoric"],
      en: ["Tomb of Queen Arwa al-Sulayhi", "Former royal palace", "Important historical pilgrimage site"],
